---
// apps/frontend/site/src/lib/components/sections/campaign_creation.astro
---

<section id="campaign" class="scroll-mt-24 border-b border-border/70">
  <div
    class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-6 py-16 md:py-20 lg:grid-cols-[.85fr_1.15fr] lg:gap-20"
  >
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-brand dark:text-brand-soft">
        01 / Create a campaign · Planned
      </p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-4xl leading-[1.08] md:text-5xl">
        A little imagination.<br>
        <em>A whole adventure.</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-md leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
        A lonely inn. A fading ward. Someone with a secret. Start with a premise, then shape the
        places, people, and quests around it.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
        Towns, inns, and roads, woven into a campaign of your own. Reusable art grounds the world;
        generated additions give it a personal touch.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-sm border border-border bg-card p-6 sm:p-8">
      <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">An adventure begins here</p>
      <blockquote class="mt-5 font-serif text-3xl leading-[1.25] md:text-4xl">
        “An old inn at the edge of a forest.<br class="hidden md:block">
        A village whose ward is fading.<br class="hidden md:block">
        A secret I can uncover with words—or a sword.”
      </blockquote>
      <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 border-t border-border pt-5 text-sm">
        <span>A place to explore</span>
        <span>A cast to meet</span>
        <span>A choice to make</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Illustrative campaign vignette</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
